Este asistente instalará IDMClone %s en este equipo.=This wizard will install IDMClone %s on your computer.
IDMClone acelera las descargas con varias conexiones, las reanuda si se cortan, las organiza en categorías y colas, y se integra en Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi y Firefox.=IDMClone speeds up downloads with several connections, resumes them when they break, organizes them in categories and queues, and integrates into Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera, Vivaldi and Firefox.
Si IDMClone está abierto, se cerrará para actualizarlo.=If IDMClone is running, it will be closed to update it.
